'''Pikachu Shocks Back issue 4''' is the eighth monthly issue of the manga series [[The Electric Tale of Pikachu]] to be released by [[VIZ Media]]. It contains the eighth chapter of the manga, ''[[ET08|You Gotta Have Friends]]''. 

The contents of this issue were included as part of {{vol|Electric Tale of Pikachu|2}} along with [[ET05]], [[ET06]], and [[ET07]].

